To: new@example.org
Subject: Someone tried to share something with you on Boardly

Hello,

someone tried to share something with this email address on Boardly. There is no Boardly account for this address.

If you sign up for Boardly with this address within 14 days, you will see the invitation there and can accept it.

If you didn't expect this, you can ignore this email.

– Boardly

